What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
class Vehicle {
    public void start() {
        System.out.print("Vehicle ");
    }
}
class Car extends Vehicle {
    @Override
    public void start() {
        System.out.print("Car ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Vehicle v = new Car();
        v.start();
    }
}
```

